# Core rules

- Only `src/lib/sequence-engine.ts` may create, update or delete `Task` rows.
  Never write task mutations in a page, component or action — actions call the engine.
- `Activity` rows are append-only. Never update or delete one.
- Calendar-day values (`Task.dueDate`) go through helpers in `src/lib/dates.ts`.
  Never do raw `new Date()` arithmetic.
- Mutations are Server Actions in `src/actions/`. Never create `src/app/api/` routes.
- Reads happen in Server Components. Do not add React Query, tRPC, Redux or any
  client-side store.
- Keep files under 250 lines; extract a component rather than growing a page.
- Protected — do not modify unless explicitly asked:
  `prisma/schema.prisma`, `src/lib/sequence-engine.ts`, `src/lib/dates.ts`, `src/lib/stats.ts`
- UI is shadcn/ui only. Never hand-roll a dropdown, dialog, popover or select.
- Tailwind utilities only. No CSS modules, no styled-components, no inline style objects.
- Do not invent colours. Use tokens from `src/app/globals.css` only; ask if a token is missing.
